  "description": "Eurobike Road Bike XC550 with 54cm frame,Dual Disc Brake and 21 Speed Shifting system\n\n【Disc Brake】The bicycle designed with dual disc brake,it provided great stopping effect and ensure you to brakes for safety at any weather conditions\n\n【21 Speed gear】Road Bike with smoothed 21 speed shifting and it can make your cycling more easy.\n\n【700Cx28C Standard tire】 700C double wall aluminum rim with the 3 spokes making the wheel stronger and more stable\n\n【 Drop-off handlebar】Choose different grip positions to adapt to different road conditions can eliminate the fatigue of the wrists, shoulders and neck caused by long-term riding\n\n【700C Mag Wheels】The bicyclce with 700C -3 spoke Magnesium alloy rims.The rolling resistance is small and the efficiency is higher. The wheels also have better rollover ability, because their circumference is larger, and they can easily pass the potholes, bumps and other obstacles on the road or path.\n\n【Assembly Guide】Bicycle are 85% pre-assembled, the assembly video instructions on the back of the picture on the product detail page can help you easily assemble in 15-20 minutes.\n\n【After-sales warranty service】Returns and exchanges are accepted within 30 days. If you have any questions about your bike, please contact us for assistance as soon as possible.\n\nProduct description\n\nEurobike XC550 road bike has a durable 54cm carbon steel frame. Great for road trips and community riding,bike suitable for 5'8-6'1\" adult riders\n\nBicycle is also the great choice for daily commuting. The 700C wheel provides the high-speed experience of road bicycle.\n\n700C x28C standard road bicycle tires can reduce the resistance when riding on gravel, urban roads or other terrain.\n\nShimano 21-speed front and rear transmission and gear handle, sealed central shaft and aluminum alloy crank transmission device provide you with a comfortable riding experience.\n\n700C magnesium alloy 3-spoke wheels are combined with the front and rear disc brakes for safe and fast braking.\n\nMen/Womens road bike has a 21-speed transmission system, and the correct use of the transmission can cope with complex road conditions and weather such as flat roads, up and down slopes, dirt roads, and top winds. It is much faster and less laborious than ordinary single speed bicycles.\n\nBicycle main parts specification",
